Date: Wed, 26 Feb 2025 09:58:58 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Mplane changes

Increase SR_OPER_CB_TIMETOUT to 120s

Use SR's pthread_mutex_timedlock and use monotonic clock.

Add LYD_OPT_TRUSTED flag to validate the notification.
Add method to get sr session context from wrapped session.

Upstream commit picked up 4d4e4cc9e31017901f9289c25a9d565f12ef83e2 to
replace defragmentation by hole storing and reusing

Signed-off-by: Romain Chaumontet <quic_rchaumon@quicinc.com>
Signed-off-by: Vishal Tripathi <quic_vishalt@quicinc.com>
